 It’s important to be thorough, so I’ll consider using exec for proper execution. I want to make sure everything runs smoothly!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Testing the specialty SLM with a small synthetic nephrology + hypertension case.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0a352616d78ef3840169d645096a708191b8877147c529ed5b\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_PxWioVOg7sCvIAv8EJ44G4XM|fc_0a352616d78ef3840169d6450979488191b6348531e10f8d4f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 scripts/query_slm_expert.py --question \"In a synthetic case, a 58-year-old with long-standing hypertension has creatinine 1.7 mg/dL, urine albumin-creatinine ratio 420 mg/g, and persistent blood pressure around 158/96 despite amlodipine. What kidney-related complications and treatment priorities should be considered?\" --domain nephrology --domain hypertension --patient-context '{\"synthetic\":true,\"age\":58,\"conditions\":[\"long-standing hypertension\",\"possible CKD with albuminuria\"],\"medications\":[\"amlodipine\"],\"labs\":{\"creatinine_mg_dl\":1.7,\"uacr_mg_g\":420},\"blood_pressure\":\"158/96\"}'","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/skills/slm-expert","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":120},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 scripts/query_slm_expert.py --question \\\"In a synthetic case, a 58-year-old with long-standing hypertension has creatinine 1.7 mg/dL, urine albumin-creatinine ratio 420 mg/g, and persistent blood pressure around 158/96 despite amlodipine. What kidney-related complications and treatment priorities should be considered?\\\" --domain nephrology --domain hypertension --patient-context '{\\\"synthetic\\\":true,\\\"age\\\":58,\\\"conditions\\\":[\\\"long-standing hypertension\\\",\\\"possible CKD with albuminuria\\\"],\\\"medications\\\":[\\\"amlodipine\\\"],\\\"labs\\\":{\\\"creatinine_mg_dl\\\":1.7,\\\"uacr_mg_g\\\":420},\\\"blood_pressure\\\":\\\"158/96\\\"}'\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/skills/slm-expert\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":120}